{"packetId":"packet-req-2-2-1","cases":[{"id":"create-organization-team-success","requirementIds":["REQ-2-2-1"],"purpose":"happy_path","expectationBasis":["The Owner clicks “New team”, enters team name `mobile-team`, which is 1 to 50 characters long containing only lowercase ASCII letters, digits, or hyphens and not beginning or ending with a hyphen, optionally enters a description and a parent team from the same organization, then clicks “Create team”.","THEN: The system redirects to the new team page, whose title displays “organization name/team name”; the team tree displays its organization and selected parent team.","THEN: After refreshing the team page or reopening the “Teams” list, the new team and its parent-child relationship remain consistent."],"steps":[{"op":"goto","path":"/"},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Sign in","exact":true}},{"op":"fill","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Username or email","exact":true},"value":"alice-dev"},{"op":"fill","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Password","exact":true},"value":"Valid-password-123!"},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"button","name":"Sign in","exact":true}},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"button","name":"alice-dev","exact":false,"fallbacks":[{"by":"role","role":"button","name":"account","exact":false}]}},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Your organizations","exact":true}},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Acme Demo","exact":true}},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Teams","exact":true}},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"New team","exact":true}},{"op":"fill","locator":{"by":"label","text":"Team name","exact":true},"value":"mobile-team"},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"button","name":"Create team","exact":true}},{"op":"expectVisible","locator":{"by":"role","role":"heading","name":"mobile-team","exact":false}},{"op":"reload"},{"op":"expectVisible","locator